391158884425_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OvSWLGaFLKwQ7kNvwHzoxR8&_nc_oc=AdrQXq6jXccAWFIWLiiWHa6o8LUzCJj9r62ORqU2G2Z6wcgZzPksajEe0ZSTsbZ_Sbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ-mb4TqJtiQEJm9sjKdDmY8PO--8ATT_snCVVLtqPdKA&oe=6AFC7822"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car Taxi City Driver Simulator VR", "keywords": ["CarTaxi", "TaxiDriver", "CityDriving", "DrivingTaxiSimulato", "VRDriving"], "long_description": "Car Taxi City Driver Simulator VR is a fun VR driving game where you drive a taxi through a city environment. Pick up passengers, drive around the city, and complete taxi driving missions while enjoying a smooth VR experience.\n\nIn Car Taxi City Driver Simulator VR, you can enjoy realistic car driving and taxi driving challenges. Follow the roads, control your car carefully, pick up passengers, and reach the destination. Practice city driving, taxi parking, and car parking while completing different driving tasks.\n\nCar Taxi City Driver Simulator VR gives you an enjoyable city driving experience in virtual reality. Improve your driving skills, control your taxi, and complete each mission. Enjoy Car Taxi City Driver Simulator VR, Car Taxi City Driver Simulator VR, and more exciting taxi driving challenges.\n\nCar Taxi City Driver Simulator VR is designed for players who enjoy car driving, taxi driving, city driving, and parking gameplay. Start Car Taxi City Driver Simulator VR and become a skilled city taxi driver.\n", "short_description": "Car Taxi City Driver Simulator VR is a fun VR taxi driving game. Drive through the city, pick up passengers, complete missions, and enjoy car driving, taxi parking, and city driving challenges.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/top-art-games/home/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Top Art Games", "support